      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1909 the Alameda Land Company laid out the Alameda Park subdivision, which was later annexed into the city of Portland.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alameda%2C_Portland%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A Broadway streetcar line served Alameda from 1910 to 1948, linking the neighborhood directly to downtown Portland.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
