      ],
      "source": "https://www.alamedaportland.com/greatplace",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Alameda Neighborhood Association hosts summer block parties, spring clean‑ups, and an annual ice‑cream social that bring neighbors together.",
